// # oohal package
//
// Logline: Canonical catalog package anchor for oohal (layers/L1-kernel).
//
// Setup: Folder shape is manifest plus payload (oohal.oo).
//
// Beats:
//   1. manifest — name, version, caps, sha256 of oohal.oo.
